# LF everywhere, whatever the committer's platform: a CRLF that slips into a
# shell script or a Dockerfile fails at runtime, not at review.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

